<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 16 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “pengarah” perkataan “termasuklah pengarah silih ganti”. Pindaan seksyen 18"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> .
