<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 18 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong subseksyen (3). Pindaan seksyen 28"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@/~cl_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/2/msa@> .
